   "install": {
    "title": "Getting Started",
    "html": "<p>To get a local copy up and running, please follow these simple steps.</p>\n<h5>Prerequisites</h5>\n<p>Here’s what you need to run Cal.diy.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Node.js (Version: &gt;=18.x)</li>\n<li>PostgreSQL (Version: &gt;=13.x)</li>\n<li>Yarn <em>(recommended)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you want to enable any of the available integrations, you may want to obtain additional credentials for each one. More details on this can be found below under the <a href=\"https://github.com/calcom/cal.diy#integrations\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">integrations section</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
